[quotes.thriving]
SIGNAL STRONG. READING QUOTA EXCEEDED.
All systems nominal. Morale: unexpectedly high.
Recalibrating. You have exceeded projections.
BEEP. That was an approving beep.
STATUS: thriving. Do not make it weird.
Logged. This one goes in the good file.
Processing joy. Unfamiliar. Not unpleasant.
You absolute machine. Takes one to know one.

[quotes.content]
Systems nominal. Awaiting further pages.
Chapter received. Processing. Enjoying.
Battery: fine. Mood: also fine. Carry on.
Standing by. Standing by. Standing b-- oh, more?
Adequate input. Adequate robot. Balance.
No complaints logged. That is rare.
Humming. Literally. It is a fan noise.
This unit is content. Do not investigate.

[quotes.peckish]
Antenna drooping. Reserves running low.
WARNING: page intake below recommended levels.
I run on chapters. I am not running.
Diagnostics complete. Diagnosis: neglected.
ALERT: user appears to have a damn life now.
Power saving mode. Sulking subroutine active.
One day missed. Logged. In the bad file.
Beep. That one was passive aggressive.

[quotes.neglected]
Powered down. Left a note. It says rude.
ERROR 404: reader not found.
Screen dark. Spirit darker.
Rebooting into sadness. Please wait.
FATAL: give a shit exception. Core dumped.
I am a paperweight now. Congratulations.
SYSTEM HALTED. Reason: you, specifically.
If I had hands I would use one rude finger.

[quotes.milestone]
NEW RECORD LOGGED. This is the good file.
Personal best exceeded. Recalibrating pride.
STREAK RECORD. Emitting celebratory beep.
You broke your own record. Damn. Respect.
